    "items": [
      {
        "item_id": "itm_578222f80c40fe5d",
        "text": "化工行业兼具周期与成长属性，子行业景气周期相互错位，使板块长期具备结构性投资机会。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_eb8c8684713c",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "化工行业兼具周期与成长属性",
            "start": 116,
            "end": 129
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": []
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_31b6d79c259707fd",
        "text": "化工品景气的本质是盈利改善，主要观察价差变化；原料价格波动较大时应重点观察产品价差。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_eb8c8684713c",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "化工品景气的本质是盈利改善，主要观察价差变化",
            "start": 221,
            "end": 243
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": []
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_cdb1436bcf8b3baf",
        "text": "仅当成本相对稳定、价格与价差走势趋于一致时，产品价格才可代表景气的变化。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "condition",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_eb8c8684713c",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "仅当成本相对稳定、价格与价差走势趋于一致时",
            "start": 265,
            "end": 286
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": []
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_e301be7d6060794b",
        "text": "研究某一子行业应明确其下游用途，梳理供需的变化；行业筛选应转向基于供需平衡表的自下而上比较。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_eb8c8684713c",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "逐步转向基于供需平衡表的自下而上比较",
            "start": 390,
            "end": 408
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": []
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_d39c8a9815eeca93",
        "text": "随着中国经济增长回归新常态，全球GDP增速放缓，需求对景气的拉动弱于以往。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_eb8c8684713c",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "需求对景气的拉动弱于以往",
            "start": 459,
            "end": 471
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": []
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_7c3a505320b50f27",
        "text": "未来的着眼点更应该放在供给的增速，如有色行业的铜、铝，化工行业的钾肥、制冷剂等。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_eb8c8684713c",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "未来的着\n眼点更应该放在供给的增速",
            "start": 472,
            "end": 489
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": []
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_8e77eae2e28e1dcc",
        "text": "具有贸易属性的化工品需求应立足全球；供给应重点关注国内新增产能。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_eb8c8684713c",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "供给应重点关注国内新增产能",
            "start": 613,
            "end": 626
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": []
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_73799bc0ba6f029c",
        "text": "部分行业开工率较高但景气未明显上升，因扩产主体为大型生产或先进装置，推高了开工率中枢。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_eb8c8684713c",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "retrospective",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "推高了开工率中枢",
            "start": 685,
            "end": 693
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": []
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_fb6060180b142785",
        "text": "有的行业80-90%的开工率即便接近历史较高水平，也不一定代表供给紧张，行业景气未必上升。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_eb8c8684713c",
        "polarity": "negated",
        "value": "80-90%",
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "也不一定代表供给紧张，行业景气未必上升",
            "start": 720,
            "end": 739
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": []
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_ebaadc761994da35",
        "text": "价格底部主要改善长期赔率，并不一定等同于中期拐点；中期投资更应关注供需改善的情况和价差扩张。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_eb8c8684713c",
        "polarity": "mixed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "并不一定等同于中期拐点",
            "start": 790,
            "end": 801
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": []
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_647378d63032a359",
        "text": "价格处于高位也不必然构成卖点，关键仍是对未来景气趋势的判断。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_eb8c8684713c",
        "polarity": "negated",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "价格处于高位也不必然构成卖点",
            "start": 827,
            "end": 841
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": []
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_c0f4a6387988ba61",
        "text": "未来的新增产能不应否定当前明确的景气阶段；只要未来一至两年供需持续改善，行业仍具备周期投资价值。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_eb8c8684713c",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "只要未来一至两年供需持续改善，行业仍具备周期投资价值",
            "start": 948,
            "end": 974
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": []
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_e8682d23e5939084",
        "text": "对于处于景气上行期的行业，应优先比较相关公司产品产能与市值的弹性，并综合考察盈利情况、成本优势。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_eb8c8684713c",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "应优先比较相关公司产品产能与市值的弹性",
            "start": 1019,
            "end": 1038
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": []
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_eddf5cceb05c545a",
        "text": "若公司多个产品同时具有涨价弹性，还需评估多个产品的综合业绩弹性。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "condition",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_eb8c8684713c",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "若公司多个产品同时具有涨价弹性",
            "start": 1055,
            "end": 1070
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": []
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_ea44a957993e6733",
        "text": "思路一：跟踪研究后续供需关系的变化，预测价格的趋势，继而做出决策，而不因当前市值位置做出决断。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_eb8c8684713c",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "而不因当前市值位置做出决断",
            "start": 1162,
            "end": 1175
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": []
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_de8af024f6493d05",
        "text": "思路二：参考产品高位的历史价格，分析未来触及的可能性和空间。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_eb8c8684713c",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "参考产品高位的历史价格，分析未来触及的可能性和空间",
            "start": 1178,
            "end": 1203
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": []
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_b199b35437ac039b",
